MAYOR OF SEMARANG,

Considering: a. that the fulfillment of constitutional rights and the protection of human rights of women and children against acts of violence is one of the values contained in Pancasila and the 1945 Constitution;
b. that violence against women and children in the City of Semarang continues to increase and spread, causing citizens to feel unsafe in carrying out their lives, thus requiring integrated protection efforts;
c. that to provide direction and legal certainty to all those involved in efforts to provide legal protection, regulation is needed regarding the protection of women and children from acts of violence;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation of the City of Semarang concerning the Protection of Women and Children From Acts of Violence.

